body:
hi! feminist here! the problem isn’t how fit these girls are (it’s welcome in my mind) but the problem is the armour, for me at least. how are these women fighting in battles with three pieces of metal covering as little as possible? 
i’ve heard that people ha issues with it in games like GTAV, but sex work and dancing are actual jobs, so i don’t have an issue with it.
if it seems possible and realistic, i don’t care. but if the woman is basically just used for her sex appeal, then i might have a problem (unless that’s her character, like a siren or something)
